      "content": "it just feels like there's no point to any of it. i spent years just watching someone fade away and i couldn't even stop it. now i'm just left with nothing. i'm so drained i can't even imagine trying to \"find light\" or whatever. it just feels like the right thing to do is to just stop. does that even make sense? like, isn't it just natural to want it all to end when you've given everything and have nothing left?",
